>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYROUTE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE PIC X(512).
01 BENEFICIARY-KIND PIC X(16).
01 EXISTING-POSTING PIC X.
01 EXISTING-RESERVATION PIC X.
01 EXISTING-CLEARING PIC X.
01 OUTPUT-CODE PIC X(32).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO BENEFICIARY-KIND EXISTING-POSTING EXISTING-RESERVATION EXISTING-CLEARING
    END-UNSTRING
    IF BENEFICIARY-KIND = "INTERNAL"
        MOVE "POST_INTERNAL" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    ELSE
        MOVE "RESERVE_EXTERNAL" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(OUTPUT-CODE)
    STOP RUN.
